OL,5,G1500 Reuben Owen: Life in the Dales
OL,6,     FAs summer ends, Reuben finishes a
OL,7,     Fpond, a cattle count turns
OL,8,     Fchaotic, and Jess tracks her wool
OL,9,     Fto Bradford. Meanwhile, Sonny and
OL,10,     FCapper's repair job turns into a
OL,11,     Fmad farmyard race.
OL,12,G1600 Reuben Owen: Life in the Dales
OL,13,     FReuben tackles a tough quarry rock
OL,14,     Fwith bold methods; it's breeding
OL,15,     Fseason for the flock; there's a
OL,16,     Frisky tree felling job; and
OL,17,     FBonfire Night brings autumn to a
OL,18,     Fclose.
